			"date": "2025-05-28T14:42:52.628Z",
			"content": "<p>Most of the content is covering SSR / metaframework stuff.</p>\n<p>What I'm astounded by is how the core model of React is bad:<br>\n- everything is pure, no need to worry<br>\n- except when it isn't<br>\n- just use useState<br>\n- except if you want performance<br>\n- here's 5 more primitives to skirt around the render cycle</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
